## Description

Implements a complete transitions system for OpenCut video editor. Transitions smooth cuts between clips with 12 built-in effects across 5 categories (dissolve, wipe, slide, zoom, blur), timeline rendering with bowtie handles, and a properties editor for duration/parameter customization.

