### New Store
- `stores/opencutTransitions.ts` - Zustand store with 12 transition definitions, apply/remove/update/select actions, category filtering

### New Components
- `TransitionsPanel.tsx` - Category tabs, search, thumbnail grid
- `TransitionThumbnail.tsx` - Preview cards with drag-and-drop, hover animation
- `TransitionHandle.tsx` - Timeline bowtie indicators with draggable duration handles
- `TransitionEditor.tsx` - Duration slider, dynamic parameter controls (color picker, sliders)

